  note: 'Victorian Steampunk: a little clockwork cat of gunmetal and brass with her own face (folded ears, amber eyes). Standing on a gear socket she winds up machines (lifts, catwalks, gear doors, the turntable); her magnet paws carry her up iron pillars marked with rivets (Jump at one).'
